                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Yay! The game of my childhood is avaliable on Steam! I was a little kid when my dad showed me this game and i still cannot believe that he always beated that ugly monkey so easily :( \n\nWhy do i love Prehistoric 2?\n- bright colors and really good pixel graphics: bears, spiders and all the other foes are soooo cute;\n- easy gameplay: you need to push only 5 buttons to move and fight;\n- tons of secrets (hit every single pixel to get everything), etra 'pig level' with a hilarious background.\n\nThis game is wonderful for 1992 (and for me)!",
